  "priority_combination_rule": "Start from the default axis weights above. Each selected priority overrides its lever: an axis priority sets that axis weight to 5; a quality-dimension priority is collected. If one or more quality-dimension priorities are selected, the quality axis weight is set to 5 and the quality sub-dimension weights are set to 1 for exactly the selected dimensions and 0 for all others. If no quality-dimension priority is selected, the quality sub-dimension weights take their defaults (intrinsic 1, maturity 0). Weights are never summed across priorities or renormalised outside the composite weighted mean.",
